<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss pension funds diversify to reduce risks.</title>
<headline>Swiss pension funds diversify to reduce risks.</headline>
<byline>Alice Ratcliffe</byline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's public and private pension funds, with over 300 billion Swiss francs under management, are seeking to diversify their investments but competition for their business is likely to be stiff.</p>
<p>&quot;They are seeking international diversification in order to balance risks,&quot; said Hans Kaufmann, analyst at Julius Baer.</p>
